  "summary": "Malicious code in keroeltopkk (npm)",
  "details": "The package's install/preinstall/postinstall hooks all run a bundled server.js that reads the machine hostname and sends it to the remote webhook endpoint eo8f3m3ho26a0nm[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net (path /keroeltopkk?h=\u003chostname\u003e) via an HTTP GET. The package is a 461-byte stub with no functionality other than this install-time host-metadata beacon.",
